@page "/components/marker"

<PageTitle>Marker — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Marker</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A small labelled mark in a stream of text — a citation, a source, a status, a break between
    days. shadcn ships it with the AI components, where it points at whatever a model is quoting;
    nothing about it is specific to a model.
</p>

