<h2 class="doc-h2">Shimmer</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>animate-pulse</code> rather than a spinner: a marker is a word in a line of text, and a
    turning circle in a sentence is a distraction rather than a signal.
</p>
<Example Source="MarkerShimmer.razor"><MarkerShimmer /></Example>

